prompt:
Create eight distinct complete right-facing basketball steal poses for Accu in a 1536×1024 transparent RGBA pixel-art sheet, strict 4-column by 2-row grid, row-major. Use the attached Accu gameplay sprite ONLY for her face, hairstyle, body identity and black/teal/violet palette. The uniform panels must be blank, with NO jersey number, text, letter, logo or symbol (the game overlays numbers). Every pose contains exactly one full human figure in its cell, same scale and floor baseline, with safe alpha spacing around every limb and both ponytails.

