Action: a quick defensive steal, with Accu reaching toward an unseen opponent who is outside the image. Eight clearly different connected poses:
0 low balanced defensive stance, hands apart and empty;
1 fast shuffle right, knees bend, near hand opens toward the unseen passing lane;
2 torso leans and lead arm reaches forward with five empty fingers spread;
3 STEAL at simulation tick5: sharp open-hand swipe across the unseen ball path; EMPTY palm, fingers extended, no object being held;
4 pulls the empty arm back toward her chest and pivots to protect space;
5 turns her shoulders toward image-right and plants the lead foot;
6 drives into a quick escape stride, both hands empty and counterbalancing;
7 upright running recovery toward image-right, empty hands, balanced.

Leave the uniform blank: no number. Leave both hands empty in all frames: no basketball. Distinct original crisp 1990s arcade pixel clusters, sharp outlines, consistent scale, true alpha-zero background and clear gutters, no alpha haze, checkerboard or matte. Return only the eight-pose sheet.
